<p>The Nord Buds 3 Pro is the best all-round earbud under ₹2,000. The 49 dB ANC is genuinely effective at blocking AC hum and office chatter. Sound signature is balanced with punchy bass that doesn't drown out mids. Call quality is clear thanks to three-mic ENC. 10 mm dynamic drivers with LDAC support means music sounds detailed even from lossless Spotify tracks. 44-hour total battery life (10 hr buds + 34 hr case).</p>

