<p><strong>Top-load advantages:</strong> Faster wash cycles (45–60 minutes), can add clothes mid-wash, cheaper, easier to load for people with back issues. Disadvantages: uses 3x more water, harsher on fabrics, agitator models can damage delicate clothes.</p>
