<p>CADR of 400 m³/hr makes this suitable for rooms up to 48 sq m. True HEPA + activated carbon filter removes PM2.5, allergens, and VOCs (paint fumes, cooking smells). Real-time AQI display. Mi Home app integration for scheduling and air quality history. Filter replacement every 6–12 months at ₹1,499 — very affordable.</p>

